1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 12=

15
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:13,020
(Shen Manor)

16
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,230
Your Lordship.

17
00:01:18,790 --> 00:01:20,180
(Invitation)
The Third Prince has sent an invitation.

18
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,870
He wishes to meet you
at Zuixian Restaurant tonight.

19
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:23,940
The Third Prince?

20
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:25,310
(Invitation)

21
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:26,310
We've only just discovered

22
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:27,920
that the dancing girls' deaths
were linked to the imperial family.

23
00:01:28,070 --> 00:01:29,390
And now the Third Prince
is hosting a banquet.

24
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:30,950
Could it be...

25
00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:31,840
Accept the invitation for now.

26
00:01:32,870 --> 00:01:34,080
Let's see what he's planning.

27
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:34,760
Yes.

28
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:58,150
This is delicious.

29
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,920
These luminous cups
were a gift from Old Madam.

30
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,510
I hear they're extremely rare.

31
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,790
I thought

32
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,110
only cups like these

33
00:02:10,310 --> 00:02:12,120
could be worthy of the kindness

34
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,480
you've both shown me.

35
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,360
Apply this sedative

36
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:22,710
to the luminous cups.

37
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,230
Make sure no one sees you.

38
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,160
Yes.

39
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,590
(Even though you)

40
00:02:31,590 --> 00:02:33,440
(somehow escaped death
on the pleasure boat,)

41
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:34,910
(I have plenty of other ways)

42
00:02:34,910 --> 00:02:36,200
(to drive you out
of the Marquis's Manor.)

43
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,430
(Once you're unconscious,)

44
00:02:38,430 --> 00:02:39,710
(I'll put you in a carriage
and send you away.)

45
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:40,720
(Then I'll tell everyone)

46
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,080
(that you two eloped with other men.)

47
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:44,270
(And just like in my previous life,)

48
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,040
(I'll enjoy all the privileges
of the Marquis's Manor.)

49
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:48,080
A toast to you both.

50
00:02:48,190 --> 00:02:48,760
Oh, wait.

51
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,390
What a coincidence.

52
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:58,880
We brought you a cup too.

53
00:03:00,190 --> 00:03:01,320
It's even the same kind.

54
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:02,990
Since we have so much in common,

55
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,230
let's

56
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,790
try drinking a different way.

57
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:14,110
A depth charge.

58
00:03:14,630 --> 00:03:15,590
It's all about

59
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:16,300
showing how close we are

60
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,080
by drinking it all in one go.

61
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,510
You're both too kind.

62
00:03:20,870 --> 00:03:21,710
I'm truly...

63
00:03:21,710 --> 00:03:23,110
Truly honored, right?

64
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,640
You're too polite.

65
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,270
Come on.

66
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:27,790
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

67
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,160
(Which cup hasn't been drugged?)

68
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:37,320
Why aren't you drinking?

69
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,510
Don't you like us?

70
00:03:40,710 --> 00:03:41,600
No, of course not.

71
00:03:43,190 --> 00:03:45,550
Since you're both being so kind,

72
00:03:45,870 --> 00:03:46,230
then

73
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,320
I'll

74
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,920
have a drink.

75
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,440
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

76
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,760
You can really hold your liquor.

77
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,150
Apply this sedative

78
00:04:17,310 --> 00:04:18,440
to the luminous cups.

79
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,950
Make sure no one sees you.

80
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,150
Yes.

81
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,120
Isn't she the heroine?

82
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:35,710
The embodiment of goodness and virtue?

83
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:38,070
Why would she drug us?

84
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:38,750
Could we have

85
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:40,150
changed the course of the story

86
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,270
and turned her into a villain?

87
00:04:41,870 --> 00:04:42,830
That's very possible.

88
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:45,270
If she dares drug us this time,

89
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:47,640
she might poison us next time.

90
00:04:48,190 --> 00:04:49,560
We'd better get out of here.

91
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:52,240
You carry her back first.

92
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:53,190
I'll clean up here.

93
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:53,830
We'll discuss it at home.

94
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:56,430
You're 1.85 meters tall.

95
00:04:56,430 --> 00:04:57,350
Who else is going to carry her?

96
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:10,800
Come on.

97
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,950
I hear you've recently married.

98
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,910
Things must be
quite lively at the manor.

99
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,030
It's a pity, though.

100
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,390
If the Marquis

101
00:05:23,390 --> 00:05:24,390
and his wife

102
00:05:24,390 --> 00:05:25,830
hadn't disobeyed military orders
back then,

103
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:26,910
they could now

104
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,510
be surrounded

105
00:05:28,830 --> 00:05:30,000
by their descendants

106
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,440
and enjoy a happy family life.

107
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Speaking of what happened back then,

108
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,710
I must thank Your Highness

109
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:39,150
for speaking
on our behalf before His Majesty.

110
00:05:40,070 --> 00:05:41,590
That's how the Marquis's Manor
was spared.

111
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:44,560
It was nothing.

112
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,270
Come.

113
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:46,150
Cheng,

114
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:47,590
let me propose a toast.

115
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:01,240
Those women back then

116
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:03,120
were severely poisoned.

117
00:06:04,830 --> 00:06:05,950
I took a precaution.

118
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:08,150
If Shen Cheng examined their bodies,

119
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,560
the poison would have gotten onto him.

120
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:13,910
This medicine

121
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,950
will activate the poison.

122
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:17,680
If he drinks it and shows symptoms,

123
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,640
kill him immediately.

124
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:20,320
Yes.

125
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,150
What?

126
00:06:25,630 --> 00:06:26,830
You're not drinking.

127
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:27,710
Could it be

128
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:30,150
that my wine isn't good enough?

129
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,270
How could I refuse

130
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,390
wine offered by Your Highness?

131
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:46,000
I still have official business
to attend to today.

132
00:06:46,270 --> 00:06:47,440
I'll take my leave now.

133
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,440
Another day,

134
00:06:48,650 --> 00:06:49,470
I'll come to apologize in person.

135
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:50,470
I won't see you out, then.

136
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,080
Follow him.

137
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:56,710
Yes.

138
00:07:02,430 --> 00:07:03,420
(There's something wrong with the wine.)

139
00:07:04,310 --> 00:07:05,560
(The Third Prince is testing me.)

140
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:06,200
Over there.

141
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:06,710
After him.

142
00:07:12,510 --> 00:07:13,390
Shen Cheng?

143
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:14,800
What's wrong?

144
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,030
What's happening?

145
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,120
It hasn't been ten days yet.

146
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:20,270
Why is your poison acting up?

147
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:22,640
Go.

148
00:07:23,070 --> 00:07:23,710
Leave me.

149
00:07:24,070 --> 00:07:24,470
There he is.

150
00:07:24,830 --> 00:07:25,080
After him!

151
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:31,800
Come on.

152
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:35,980
Don't try to fight them.

153
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:36,710
Listen to me.

154
00:07:40,070 --> 00:07:40,560
Search the place.

155
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,320
They escaped through the window.

156
00:07:49,950 --> 00:07:50,470
Hurry after them.

157
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,030
Hang in there.

158
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:04,080
I'll draw some blood
to neutralize the poison.

159
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:09,240
Since you've already decided
to separate from me,

160
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,560
why do you still care
whether I live or die?

161
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,600
This is no time for that.

162
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,440
Stop being difficult.

163
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,600
Your life is at stake.

164
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,680
And you're still worried about that?

165
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,200
Shen Cheng.

166
00:08:57,670 --> 00:08:59,320
What if fate has destined you

167
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,590
to be with another woman?

168
00:09:03,910 --> 00:09:04,830
She saves you,

169
00:09:05,870 --> 00:09:06,520
and you protect her.

170
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:10,350
You're the perfect match.

171
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:16,450
♪Flowers in bloom♪

172
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:18,350
What if she's about to return?

173
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:21,950
What do you think I should do?

174
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,630
♪A gentle breeze♪

175
00:09:24,150 --> 00:09:25,280
What fate?

176
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:27,830
My fate

177
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,320
is mine to decide.

178
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:30,710
Whoever I choose

179
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,920
is the one I'm destined to be with.

180
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:36,520
What about you?

181
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:40,400
After everything we've been through,

182
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,920
would you leave me because of this

183
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,400
so-called destiny?

184
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:50,990
Ever since that night
you took my medicine,

185
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,200
you've belonged to me.

186
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:59,870
♪Let the gentle breeze begin
the story of our love♪

187
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:01,080
I won't let you leave me.

188
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,230
Do you understand?

189
00:10:04,910 --> 00:10:07,930
♪Reflecting your face♪

190
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:13,920
♪No longer hiding
the slightest urge to embrace you♪

191
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:14,710
If you won't accept it,

192
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:16,520
neither will I.

193
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:21,830
♪In all my years
of wandering through lifetimes♪

194
00:10:22,130 --> 00:10:25,410
♪Hand in hand, we'll walk through♪

195
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:31,750
♪Spring, summer, fall, and winter♪

196
00:10:34,210 --> 00:10:36,530
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

197
00:10:36,530 --> 00:10:43,730
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

198
00:10:43,730 --> 00:10:48,930
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

199
00:10:50,130 --> 00:10:55,170
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

200
00:10:56,530 --> 00:11:01,610
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

201
00:11:02,970 --> 00:11:08,090
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

202
00:11:09,370 --> 00:11:12,730
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

203
00:11:31,490 --> 00:11:34,850
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
